{
  "id": "E406",
  "title": "Are We Buying A Puppy?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-02-23",
  "synopsis": "Finally, mom is letting me buy a puppy! Or is she?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50406/7611d282753f74f4eb3225f5a51069c63c35b292.mp3?1581942258",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我们买狗吗\n \n妈妈：（对服务员）你好，一共多少钱？\n服务员：300元。请您看一下。\n妈妈：（对服务员）麻烦你可以帮我们把没吃完的菜打包吗？我想带回去给狗吃。\n服务员：当然可以，没问题。请您稍等。\n女儿：（坐在旁边，兴奋地说）妈妈，我们真的要买狗了吗？\n",
    "traditional": "我們買狗嗎\n \n媽媽：（對服務員）你好，一共多少錢？\n服務員：300元。請您看一下。\n媽媽：（對服務員）麻煩你可以幫我們把沒吃完的菜打包嗎？我想帶回去給狗吃。\n服務員：當然可以，沒問題。請您稍等。\n女兒：（坐在旁邊，興奮地說）媽媽，我們真的要買狗了嗎？\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n \n",
      "traditional": "\n \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are we buying a puppy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "妈妈：（对服务员）你好，一共多少钱？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：（對服務員）你好，一共多少錢？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma duì fú wù yuán nǐ hǎo yí gòng duō shao qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: (to the waiter) Hello, how much is it in total?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "服务员：300元。请您看一下。",
      "traditional": "服務員：300元。請您看一下。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán 2 yuán qǐng nín kàn yí xià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: 300 yuan. Please take a look."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妈妈：（对服务员）麻烦你可以帮我们把没吃完的菜打包吗？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：（對服務員）麻煩你可以幫我們把沒吃完的菜打包嗎？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma duì fú wù yuán má fan nǐ kě yǐ bāng wǒ men bǎ méi chī wán de cài dǎ bāo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我想带回去给狗吃。",
      "traditional": "我想帶回去給狗吃。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng dài huí qù gěi gǒu chī",
      "english": "Mom: (to the waiter) Can we trouble you to help us put the unfinished food in a doggy bag?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I want to take it back to feed the dog."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "服务员：当然可以，没问题。请您稍等。",
      "traditional": "服務員：當然可以，沒問題。請您稍等。",
      "pinyin": "fú wù yuán dāng rán kě yǐ méi wèn tí qǐng nín shāo děng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Of course, no problem. Please wait a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "女儿：（坐在旁边，兴奋地说）妈妈，我们真的要买狗了吗？",
      "traditional": "女兒：（坐在旁邊，興奮地說）媽媽，我們真的要買狗了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǚ ér zuò zài páng biān xīng fèn de shuō mā ma wǒ men zhēn de yào mǎi gǒu le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Daughter: (sitting beside, saying excitedly) Mom, are we really going to buy a puppy?"
    }
  ],
